# CPZ: the panel, touch and keyboard modules are built out-of-tree against the
# kernel installed in this image. rpi-update would replace that kernel without
# rebuilding them, leaving the device without a working console. Keep the
# package uninstallable so a user (or a stray dependency) cannot break the
# image by accident. Kernel updates come with a new image from pi-gen.
Package: rpi-update
Pin: release *
Pin-Priority: -1
